-- s 49(1) penalty for the employer (NOTES QA2): the tier of the driver's reason, as s 49(3) applies to the driver's
-- (1)(a) offence. Penalty (a), never licensed or a novice: 6 PU, or 12 PU after an earlier s 49(1) conviction of the
-- employer (s 49(6)); no minimum, no imprisonment. Penalty (b), penalty enforcement: 4 to 30 PU and up to 12 months,
-- disqualification optional. Penalty (c), refused, disqualified, cancelled, suspended or prescribed: 8 to 40 PU and
-- 12 months, or 20 to 80 PU and 18 months for a subsequent offence, and compulsory disqualification. No arrest
-- without warrant: s 49(3) gives it over the driver.
